{
  "title": "AI Documents: Ask About a File in a Chat, Charts Included | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A person has a file and a question, such as a policy, a report or a contract. With CrestApps AI Documents, they attach the file to a chat and the assistant answers from it. The file belongs to that chat only, and a vision model can describe the charts inside it, so the assistant can answer about them too.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why people attach files to a chat\n• What can be attached: text, PDF, Word, PowerPoint, spreadsheets, and figures\n• The Documents section of Settings > Artificial Intelligence, and the Default vision deployment\n• Allowing uploads and describing figures on a profile\n• Attaching a file and asking about it\n• Asking about a chart in a PDF report",
